  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISS 2009-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISS 2009-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISS, based in Pretoria, is a human security research institution,     working towards a stable and peaceful Africa characterized by         sustainable development, human rights, the rule of law, democracy and collaborative security. The support to ISS was evaluated during 2008. The conclusions of the evaluation were in general very positive, why  Sida has decided on continuing to support the organisation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISS, baserad i Pretoria, &#xe4;r en organisation verksam inom omr&#xe5;det      m&#xe4;nsklig s&#xe4;kerhet, och arbetar mot ett stabilt och fredligt Afrika    karakt&#xe4;riserat av h&#xe5;llbar utveckling, m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter,          r&#xe4;ttss&#xe4;kerhet, demokrati och s&#xe4;kerhetssamverkan. St&#xf6;det till ISS      utv&#xe4;rderades under 2008. Slutsatserna av utv&#xe4;rderingen var generellt  sett positiva, varf&#xf6;r Sida beslutat om fortsatt st&#xf6;d.</narrative>
  </description>
